.TH AURORA-SETTINGS 1
.SH NAME
aurora-settings \- native Aurora Desktop system settings interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aurora-settings
.RI [ list | show KEY | set KEY VALUE | category CATEGORY | reset ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Controls the persistent user-facing Aurora settings model. Categories include system, devices, network, personalization, apps, accounts, time-language, accessibility, privacy-security, compatibility, system-services, drivers-hardware, and developer.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/chimera/settings.conf
